{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$description": "SKYPhoenix immutable brand tokens. Every value extracted from CompanyWebsite (read-only) on 2026-07-18; source file:line per token in $extensions.source. See references/source-ledger.md. Do not add values without evidence.",
